            <ArticleTitle>Peripheral neuropathies: new recommendations for neuropathic pain pharmacotherapy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>250-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1038/nrneurol.2015.36</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A recent review and meta-analysis on pharmacotherapy for neuropathic pain provides a precise update on treatment efficacy and adverse effects. The authors offer revised evidence-based recommendations for first-line therapies and subsequent options, but we still a need to improve individual treatment decisions, including nonpharmacological therapies, in affected patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
